  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Transition and Responsible Business Conduct in Montenegro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of the project is to enhance Montenegro&#x2019;s circular economy by fostering the application of responsible business conduct at the enterprise level, encouraging industrial symbiosis, a collaborative approach where businesses utilize waste and by-products from their processes. This approach seeks to address critical challenges of decent work at the enterprise level, including inefficient resource use, high waste generation, and limited awareness of circular economy principles amo</narrative>
  </description>
